<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><b>Item 8.01.&#160;Other Events.</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">On July 22, 2026, Raphael Zagury, the Chief Executive Officer of
the Twenty One Capital, Inc. (the &#8220;Company&#8221;), presented in a fireside chat at the Mining Disrupt 2026 conference
regarding the Company&#8217;s strategic priorities on operating businesses, capital allocation, mergers and acquisitions and
management model. A copy of the transcript of the fireside chat is attached as Exhibit 99.1 to this Current Report on Form 8-K and is
incorporated herein by reference.</p>

